  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large bento box over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the diced yautia and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, and salt. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the long-grain rice and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the coconut cream and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot with a squeeze of lime juice.",
